   "y": -175
  },
  "p3intro": {
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "AI in context: the PayPal AI panel working next to real screens. Each flow pairs a passive Read screen with an agentic Act conversation, then the result.",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": -260
  },
  "p3n0": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "The AI panel stays open beside whichever page the user is on, so answers can point at what is on screen. (Copy of the flow on the previous page.)\n\n1. Dining · on Transactions\n2. What’s due · on Recurring",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 0
  },
  "p3n2": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: a calendar widget of upcoming free trial expiry dates.\nAct: the user asks to start a trial without being charged; the agent starts it, pays with PayPal and schedules an automatic cancellation the day before the first $49.99 charge.\n\n1. Read · Free trials calendar widget\n2. Act · Agent starts the trial, schedules auto-cancel\n3. Result · Trial on Recurring, auto-cancel set",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 1400
  },
  "p3n5": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: a push notification about a suspicious $450 charge.\nAct: “That wasn’t me.” The agent freezes the debit card, files an unauthorized-transaction claim and orders a replacement card. The PayPal balance keeps working online meanwhile.\n\n1. Read · Suspicious charge notification\n2. Act · Agent freezes, files the claim, orders a new card\n3. Result · Frozen card, replacement ordered",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 2800
  },
  "p3n7": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: a list showing the user pays $22.99 a month for Cinebox Premium.\nAct: “Downgrade my Cinebox to the $6.99 ad-supported tier.” The agent changes the tier in the billing portal instead of cancelling.\n\n1. Read · Premium plan at $22.99/mo\n2. Act · Agent switches to the ad-supported tier\n3. Result · Subscription at $6.99/mo",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 4200
  },
  "p3n8": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: the subscription’s details on Recurring.\nAct: “Cancel my Vantage subscription.” The agent explains it will open the merchant’s site in a secure browser, and nothing changes until the user approves.\nApprove: the user reviews and confirms in a dialog.\nAct: the agent works through the merchant’s cancellation steps and the user watches each one.\nResult: Vantage is cancelled, a confirmation number and screenshot are saved, and Undo stays available.\n\n1. Read\n2. Ask\n3. Approve\n4. Run\n5. Result",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 5600
  },
  "p3n9": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 875,
   "page": "aictx",
   "text": "Read: the Budget page shows $779.19 left this month.\nAsk: “What if I skip dining out for the rest of October?” The agent projects to Oct 31 and shows Now beside What if, with the change in each row.\nAsk: “What if I buy a $900 laptop today?” The side-by-side shows it would pass the $3,000 card limit, and suggests an alternative.\nResult: the user applies the first scenario as a lower dining limit, and the Budget page reflects it.\n\n1. Read\n2. Skip dining\n3. Buy a laptop\n4. Apply",
   "w": 480,
   "x": -560,
   "y": 7000
  },
  "p3t0": {
   "kind": "title1",
