   "page": "addlink",
   "text": "NEW · Add an item from a link (static preview, not on Final yet).\n\nPaste any product link; Stella reads the page, builds a listing with photo and price, and it joins the Essentials grid. Paying uses a PayPal order with the item link and photo.\n\n1. Paste a link\n2. Listing built · price editable\n3. Added to the grid · Undo\n4. Pay with PayPal",
   "w": 480,
